{"title":"Tief im Ozean","puid":"c-natdeu-3/cwb1sw","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/level-01","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>bubbles</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/02_Tauchen-copy.lsg","width":350},"colors":{"purple":"rgba(126,87,194,1)","pink":"rgba(240,98,146,1)","yellow":"rgba(255,235,59,1)","cyan":"rgba(38,198,218,1)"},"instruction":{"text":"Lies genau. Male dann das Bild mit den richtigen Farben aus.","speaker":true},"atoms":{"a":"Heute macht Celina einen Tauchausflug im tiefen Ozean. Dafür trägt sie einen lila Tauchanzug und an ihren Füßen gelbe Flossen. So kann sie unter Wasser blitzschnell schwimmen.","tasks":[{"class":"diver","color":"purple","total":1},{"class":"foot","color":"yellow","total":2}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>bubbles</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/02_Tauchen_2.lsg","width":350},"colors":{"pink":"rgba(240,98,146,1)","green":"rgba(76,175,80,1)","orange":"rgba(249,168,37,1)","red":"rgba(239,83,80,1)"},"instruction":{"text":"Lies genau. Male dann das Bild mit den richtigen Farben aus.","speaker":true},"atoms":{"a":"Plötzlich saust ein kleines, oranges Seepferdchen an ihr vorbei. Auf dem Meeresboden entdeckt Celina viele bunte Korallen, die sich im Wasser hin und her wiegen, als würden sie einen lustigen Tanz aufführen. Sie sind grün, rot und orange.<br> Celina fühlt sich, als wäre sie in einer anderen Welt – alles um sie herum ist still und geheimnisvoll.","tasks":[{"class":"seahorse","color":"orange","total":1},{"class":"coral","color":"green","total":1},{"class":"coral","color":"orange","total":1},{"class":"coral","color":"red","total":1}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>bubbles</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/02_Tauchen_3.lsg","width":350},"colors":{"orange":"rgba(255,152,0,1)","blue":"rgba(41,121,255,1)","yellow":"rgba(255,241,118,1)","purple":"rgba(206,147,216,1)"},"instruction":{"text":"Lies genau. Male dann das Bild mit den richtigen Farben aus.","speaker":true},"atoms":{"a":"Ein kleiner oranger Fisch mit drei leuchtend blauen Streifen huscht zwischen den Korallen hindurch. Seine hellgelben Flossen blinken im dunklen Wasser wie kleine Taschenlampen. Neugierig folgt Celina ihm mit den Augen. Dabei entdeckt sie eine lila Qualle, die geheimnisvoll im Licht schimmert.","tasks":[{"class":"stripe","color":"blue","total":3},{"class":"body","color":"orange","total":2},{"class":"top","color":"yellow","total":2},{"class":"bottom","color":"yellow","total":2},{"class":"back","color":"yellow","total":1},{"class":"side","color":"yellow","total":1},{"class":"jellyfish","color":"purple","total":1}]}}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Lesen – Genau lesen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/topic","puid":"c-natdeu-3/5dgag3"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Lesen und Ausmalen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/block","puid":"c-natdeu-3/mdf917"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/custom/bubbles","etag":"1367-20480"},{"fileId":"sound/de/f5_2025/Lies genau. Male dann das Bild mit den richtigen Farben aus.","etag":"daae-16383"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3_2025/<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>bubbles</voice>","isMultiSound":true}],"svgs":[{"fileId":"svg/c-svg/2022/02/10-seaanimal10.svg","etag":"a8e0-19128"},{"fileId":"svg/c-svg/2022/03/31-plongeur.svg","etag":"070f-16275"},{"fileId":"svg/c-svg/2022/08/03-coral03.sv